            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Which of the following mixtures are correctly classified as homogeneous (Hm) and heterogeneous (Ht)? Choose the correct option."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.216,
            0.814,
            0.233
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Air — Hm, Milk — Ht, Sugar solution — Hm, Smoke — Hm"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.263,
            0.233,
            0.806,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Brass — Ht, Fog — Ht, Vinegar — Ht, Muddy water — Hm"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.258,
            0.25,
            0.86,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) Copper sulfate solution — Hm, Salt solution — Hm, Milk — Hm, Bronze — Hm"
